Data bundled in app/src/main/assets, each under its own terms:

- municipios.bin: adapted from IBGE, Malha Municipal 2022 (CC BY 4.0).
- listas/flora_brasil.zip: adapted from Flora e Funga do Brasil, Instituto de
  Pesquisas Jardim Botânico do Rio de Janeiro (CC BY 4.0). The original
  eml.xml is kept inside the file.
- listas/fauna_brasil.zip: adapted from Catálogo Taxonômico da Fauna do
  Brasil (CC BY 4.0). The original eml.xml is kept inside the file.
- geoide_egm2008.bin: derived from the EGM2008 geoid model of the U.S.
  National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (NGA), through the 5-minute grid
  distributed by GeographicLib.
- licencas/google_play_services.txt: third-party notices shipped inside the
  Google Play services libraries.

Map tiles are loaded at runtime from OpenStreetMap
(© OpenStreetMap contributors, https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
